      "type": "base",
      "description": "<p>Your inner wellspring is <strong>air</strong>.</p><ul><li>You <strong>always</strong> treat the <strong>air wellspring</strong> as being available during each scene.</li><li>You may perform Rituals of the <strong>Elementalism</strong> discipline, but only if those Rituals manipulate the <strong>air</strong> element.</li><li>You gain <strong>air</strong> Resistance.</li><li>When you deal damage, you may change its type to <strong>air</strong>. If you do, that damage ignores Resistances.</li></ul>",
